{"id":58473,"ord":159,"n_segments":204,"prev":58472,"next":58474,"doc":{"id":"68359","title":"68359_Zutty Singleton oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Zutty Singleton","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/68359/","url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=68359"},"chapter":"Zutty's stroke and friends","title":"No check-ups, and Dr. MacDonald","category":"health_personal","summary":"They hadn't seen a doctor in years; the last, Dr. MacDonald, who also treated Pee Wee Russell, told Zutty to put on his clothes and get out, and Dance is offered cakes.","period":"1960s","year_from":1960,"year_to":1969,"words":129,"start":[242,3],"end":[243,10],"url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=68359#s58473","tags":{"places":[],"venues":[],"bands":[]},"people":[{"name":"Doctor MacDonald","qid":null,"n":2},{"name":"Zutty Singleton","qid":"Q231113","n":1},{"name":"Marge Singleton","qid":"Q15833848","n":1},{"name":"Doctor Murphy","qid":null,"n":1},{"name":"Pee Wee Russell","qid":"Q718419","n":1}],"story":{"theme":28,"theme_name":"Illness, injury and the deaths of colleagues","community":52,"community_name":"Illness, injury and death among jazz musicians","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":242,"b":3,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Had you had any, I mean did you had you been going to the doctor for check-ups or anything?"},{"p":242,"b":4,"s":"MRS. SINGLETON","x":"No."},{"p":242,"b":5,"s":"MR. SINGLETON","x":"No."},{"p":242,"b":6,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Never bothered."},{"p":242,"b":7,"s":"MR. SINGLETON","x":"The last doctor I went to was a doctor, what's his name, Marge?"},{"p":242,"b":8,"s":"MRS. SINGLETON","x":"Murphy ?"},{"p":242,"b":9,"s":"MR. SINGLETON","x":"No, doctor that told me ...."},{"p":242,"b":10,"s":"MRS. SINGLETON","x":"Oh yes, my doctor, Doctor MacDonald."},{"p":242,"b":11,"s":"MR. SINGLETON","x":"Doctor MacDonald was the last one."},{"p":242,"b":12,"s":"MRS. SINGLETON","x":"That was Peewee Russel's doctor. He's the one operated on me."},{"p":243,"b":0,"s":"MRS. SINGLETON","x":"Take some of those!"},{"p":243,"b":1,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Oh, thank you."},{"p":243,"b":2,"s":"MRS. SINGLETON","x":"Take a couple of them."},{"p":243,"b":3,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Oh no, I don't want a big......"},{"p":243,"b":4,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"That's very nice, thank you."},{"p":243,"b":5,"s":"MR. SINGLETON","x":"He told me to ...."},{"p":243,"b":6,"s":"MRS. SINGLETON","x":"Get the hell out of here."},{"p":243,"b":7,"s":"MR. SINGLETON","x":"Put on your clothes and get the hell out of here! That's what he told me."},{"p":243,"b":8,"s":"MRS. SINGLETON","x":"And Zutto was so happy."},{"p":243,"b":9,"s":"MR. SINGLETON","x":"Yes. I was feeling fine."},{"p":243,"b":10,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Yes."}]}